WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.560
- Hello there, I'm Gav.

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:03.380
- I'm Dan.
- We're The Slow Mo Guys.

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:04.410
Dan, what would you say

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:06.460
is the most interesting natural disaster?

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:08.370
- I'm quite impressed by
things like tornadoes.

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:09.203
- Tornadoes, good.
- They're pretty cool.

00:00:09.203 --> 00:00:10.400
- I quite like wildlife.

00:00:11.239 --> 00:00:14.350
- Should we sort of combine the two?

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:15.880
- Melting pot.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:18.040
The fire tornado is
actually, surprisingly,

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:19.210
a naturally-occurring event.

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:20.360
Pretty rare.
- Pretty awesome.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:22.340
- Pretty awesome, so
we're gonna recreate it

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:25.033
with about 12 box fans in
a circle and some fire.

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.030
- Okay, so we've got about half an inch

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.420
of kerosene in there.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:33.310
Just gonna light it, step
back, and let it build up

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:34.510
and then we'll just
turn the fans on, okay?

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:36.820
- All right, I'm ready on Phantom.

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:37.653
- Here we go.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:40.750
- Yeah, that's lit.

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:43.233
- Okay, I'll just let it build up.

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:52.173
- Go for it.

00:00:52.173 --> 00:00:53.006
- Yep.

00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:04.693
- Oh sweet.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.300
That's like 10 foot there.

00:01:10.959 --> 00:01:14.292
- [Dan] Oh that's awesome, look at that.

00:01:15.128 --> 00:01:15.961
- [Gavin] That's class.

00:01:15.961 --> 00:01:17.018
- [Dan] That's cool.

00:01:17.018 --> 00:01:17.851
- That got really high.

00:01:17.851 --> 00:01:18.934
- [Dan] Yeah.

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:20.813
- [Gavin] Can feel the heat.

00:01:20.813 --> 00:01:22.281
- [Dan] Yeah, I still.

00:01:22.281 --> 00:01:23.114
If it wasn't hot enough.

00:01:23.114 --> 00:01:24.083
- Look at that.

00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:25.290
- [Dan] It's literally a perfect spiral.

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:26.123
Look at that.

00:01:26.123 --> 00:01:27.290
That's wicked.

00:02:27.997 --> 00:02:30.780
- Well Dan, I'm not bein'
funny, that looked phenomenal.

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:32.000
- Yeah, looks amazing doesn't it?

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:32.890
- I'm always wafflin' on

00:02:32.890 --> 00:02:35.380
about how liquids and flame looks good.

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:37.070
Spinning flame, even better.

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:38.820
I think from now on, all
flames should be spinning.

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:41.810
- Yeah, it looked so good,
I just wanted to it eat it.

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:42.643
- It did look good enough to eat.

00:02:42.643 --> 00:02:43.540
- It looked so smooth.
- I've never wanted

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:45.650
to eat fire before.
- Yeah, looked so nice.

00:02:45.650 --> 00:02:46.483
- It was golden.

00:02:46.483 --> 00:02:47.316
Did you get singed?

00:02:47.316 --> 00:02:48.560
- Actually, for once, I
didn't lose any arm hair,

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:50.430
no eyebrows, no hair, nothing.

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:51.700
I was all right.
- We played it safe.

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:52.550
- Quite happy with that.

00:02:52.550 --> 00:02:55.388
- Feel free to follow us
on Twitter, buy a shirt.

00:02:55.388 --> 00:02:57.310
Thank you very much for watching.

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:58.560
- Yeah, see ya next time.

